      "text": "Read docs\\SETUP.md and docs\\IT-PREREQUISITES.md. Explain prerequisites, installed-first module preview and independent Core/SDK/Extensions/WSL installs chosen by the human. Existing tools skip download/upgrade; incompatible/unknown inventory fails without download, including stale PATH discovery. Missing pre-setup outputs can cause expected optional Verify exit 1. Normal setup never invokes Microsoft bundle or global tweaks; a stopped partial base is not completed. Legacy bundle/SkipBase is optional only after confirmed successful base/resume. Explain automated missing extensions and approved source/profile acceptance. Separate human Restore, no-restore tests, GitHub CI and AKS approval. You may run only preflight.ps1 and verify.ps1 without RunConfigTest. Do not run module setup, repair, policy/auth/launch/deployment actions.",
