      "text": "Use the extend-emi-api skill and repository instructions to add POST /emi/schedule only in samples\\python-emi-api. Use Decimal and ROUND_HALF_UP; fixed two-decimal monetary strings and Indian INR grouping. Preserve existing rounded EMI and POST /emi total_payment. Accept optional paired prepayment_amount/prepayment_month. Each month round interest, apply regular installment, then one-time prepayment to remaining principal after that month's payment. Shorten tenure without lowering EMI. Reject invalid/unpaired inputs and prepayment above remaining principal. Final installment is exactly remaining principal plus rounded interest; never create a negative balance. Add no-prepayment, valid/invalid prepayment, shortened-tenure, settlement and rounding tests. Run only no-download/no-restore checks with the existing pinned environment. If unavailable, report NOT RUN; do not install, launch or change another sample.",
